<title>HONG KONG: Hang Lung cut stake in Amoy.</title>
<headline>Hang Lung cut stake in Amoy.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hang Lung Development Co Ltd cut its stake in Amoy Properties Ltd to 45.05 percent from 51.53 percent on November 29, trading records issued by the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong on Friday showed.</p>
<p>The deal left Hang Lung with 1.13 billion shares in Amoy compared with 1.29 billion shares previously, the records revealed.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
